NAO has the MSGTYPE patch for that and other situations to force the game
to give a --More-- prompt; it's also nice for messages that annoy you and
you'd like to suppress. Documentation and a link to the patchdb entry (in
case you don't play on NAO) can be found on the wiki:
    http://nethackwiki.com/wiki/MSGTYPE

Enforcing a --More-- prompt for the monster summoning messages and maybe
for messages indicating there's a mind flayer on the level seems like a
good idea to me.

